        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Section 19.1 Severability. Should any part hereof or any provision herein contained be rendered or declared invalid by reason of any existing or subsequently enacted legislation or by any decree by a court of competent jurisdiction, such invalidation of any such part or portion of this Agreement shall not invalidate the remaining portions hereof and they shall remain in full force and effect.",
